  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FLACSO Capacity Development Programme 2013-2015 - FLACSO 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FLACSO kapacitetsutvecklingsprogram 2013-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet best&#xe5;r av tre delar: 1) ett mastersprogram eller           alternativt en specialisering inom samh&#xe4;llsvetenskap f&#xf6;r social       utveckling med fokus p&#xe5; rurala regioner; 2) forskning om fattigas     inkomst (dess karakt&#xe4;r, hur den kan h&#xf6;jas och vilka effekter det kan  ha f&#xf6;r individerna samt f&#xf6;r landet); samt skapa offentlig debatt      kring &#xe4;mnet; och 3) ett st&#xf6;d till institutionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme consists of three parts: 1) A masters programme or      alternatively a specialisation in social management of human and      social development with focus on rural regions; 2) research on the    income for the poor (how to increase the income and what effects an   increase can have on the families and also on a national level) and   promote a public debate on the issue; 3) and institutional support.</narrative>
  </description>
